<sn><md>### Remove the specified directory too

By default, the main directory may not be removed. To remove it as well if it is empty:

```bash
rclone rmdirs mega:Documents --leave-root=false
```

**Preview before deleting**

```bash
rclone rmdirs mega:Documents --dry-run
```

This lets you check which empty directories would be removed without actually deleting them.
</md></sn>